  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ man agife ælce teoðunga to ðam ealdum mynstrum þe seo hyrnes tohyrð; ⁊ þæt sy þonne swa gelæst, ægðer ge of ðegnes inlande ge of neatlande, swa hit seo sulh gegange.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all tithes shall be paid to the old churches to which obedience is due; and payment shall be made both from the thegn's demesne land and the land held by his tenants—all that is under the plough.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ man agífe ælce teoðunge to þam ealdan mynstre þe seo hernes tohyrð; ⁊ þæt sy þonne swa gelæst, ægðer ge of þegnes inlande ge of geneatlande, swa his sulh gega.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
